---
title: Text conversion workspace containers
---
flowchart LR
  subgraph Input["Input and document preparation"]
    Browser["Browser interface for selecting a text document and its output preferences"]
    Gateway["Request gateway for checking the document identifier and conversion options"]
    Importer["Document importer for reading the selected source bytes into a working copy"]
    Decoder["Text decoder for converting the working copy into a common character encoding"]
    Normalizer["Whitespace normalizer for preserving paragraphs while unifying line endings"]
  end

  subgraph Analysis["Structure and content analysis"]
    Validator["Structure validator for checking headings, lists, and paragraph boundaries"]
    Segmenter["Section segmenter for assigning stable identifiers to document sections"]
    Annotator["Term annotator for attaching definitions to selected words and phrases"]
    Catalog["Section catalog for recording the document structure and section ordering"]
    Indexer["Search index builder for collecting words and their section references"]
  end

  subgraph Assembly["Selection and page assembly"]
    Query["Section selection service for applying the requested reading range and filters"]
    Sorter["Section ordering service for arranging selected sections in document order"]
    Assembler["Page assembly service for combining section text, headings, and annotations"]
    Formatter["Layout formatter for applying the selected page width and text size"]
    Preview["Preview generator for producing a readable sample of the formatted pages"]
  end

  subgraph Output["Output preparation and delivery"]
    Checker["Output checker for confirming that every selected section appears in the result"]
    Packager["Document packager for collecting formatted pages and a contents list"]
    Exporter["Export writer for creating the requested downloadable document format"]
    Download["Download interface for presenting the completed document to the reader"]
  end

  Browser -->|submit selection| Gateway
  Gateway -->|accept request| Importer
  Importer -->|source bytes| Decoder
  Decoder -->|decoded text| Normalizer
  Normalizer -->|normalized paragraphs| Validator
  Validator -->|validated structure| Segmenter
  Segmenter -->|identified sections| Annotator
  Annotator -->|annotated sections| Catalog
  Catalog -->|ordered section records| Indexer
  Indexer -->|searchable references| Query
  Query -->|selected sections| Sorter
  Sorter -->|ordered selection| Assembler
  Assembler -->|assembled pages| Formatter
  Formatter -->|formatted pages| Preview
  Preview -->|preview and pages| Checker
  Checker -->|checked pages| Packager
  Packager -->|document package| Exporter
  Exporter -->|completed document| Download
